# turbo-fit-tok-s-updater
owner: turbosovth · cadence: after each run · status: SUGGESTED
**Every time TurboFit runs a model, want me to loop in the best tok/s it hit and update that column on your TurboFit list?**

## Prompt
Read the latest TurboFit run results and update the best tok/s value in the tok/s column of the TurboFit list, dropping any stale higher figure.

## Evidence
> On the turbo fit list, remove the type column, but instead replace that with a tokens per second column, which will show the best tokens per second that we've achieved with each one of those.
